covers a lightsaber owned by leia a  flashback shows Luke training leia in  some badass lightsaber combat and they  use more archived footage of Mark  Hamill's and Carrie Fisher's younger  appearances really of all the Star Wars  films the rise of Skywalker has the most  in common with Return of the Jedi  Palpatine emerging from the shadows to  offer a hero a deal with the devil the  character we thought was a villain  actually rediscovering his soul in  Redemption Lando back in a falcon where  he belongs  but more than anything it shows us a  Return of the Jedi and now that Jedi  includes Leia her voice joins a  cacophony of all the other Jedi who  speak down to Rey in her darkest moment  but this disembodied voice leads us to  the question what exactly happened to  Leia like how did she die  but before he continued this video was  sponsored by audible in their unmatched  selection of audio books and other audio  products this holiday season he might  have gotten some real stinker gifts  thanks a lot Nana give yourself a gift  that you'll love the gift of audible  membership membership includes one free  audio book a month in to audible  originals unlike a streaming a rental  service with audible you  all your books and you get to keep them  even if you cancel I got dune by Frank  Herbert's classic so that I could brush  up on my sand worm knowledge ahead of  the 2020 film version by Din evil noob  they got tons of dune titles as well as  Star Wars and Game of Thrones pretty  much a sci-fi and fantasy audio paradise  members stay motivated and inspired with  unlimited access to exclusive guided  fitness and meditation programs perfect  for helping you stick with those New  Year's resolutions start listening with  a 30 day audible trial choose one  audiobook in two audible originals  absolutely free visit audible.com slash  new rock stars or text new rock stars to  500 500 again that's audible.com slash  new rock stars or text new rock stars -  500 500 for one audio